  "ingredients": [
    "2.5 pounds chicken wings",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "0.66666668653488 cup cayenne pepper sauce",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "2 tablespoons vinegar",
    "1 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "0.25 teaspoon cayenne pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat an air fryer to 360 degrees F (180 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uFzS2Oqks-K7VNlObHAOkyxH4Sw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-270194-air-fryer-buffalo-chicken-wings-VAT-step-01-9eecb44af09d44a2be13a70b7f1d33dd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/270194/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place wings in a large bowl; drizzle oil over wings and massage until chicken is evenly coated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NJ7sqSdrZvCi6erl7UKgR-95Eq4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-270194-air-fryer-buffalo-chicken-wings-VAT-step-02-aabae2654fba48308f7056a16e041bb1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/270194/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange 1/2 of the wings in a single layer in the air fryer basket.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gjTqBSZ4txk3Gv4CqK2KCfxMGas=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-270194-air-fryer-buffalo-chicken-wings-VAT-step-03-5f63ed5d25934814b27c44e47362fa73.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/270194/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook in the preheated air fryer for 25 minutes. Use tongs to flip wings and cook until golden brown and crisp on the outside, 5 minutes more. Transfer cooked wings to a large bowl; cover to keep warm. Repeat with remaining wings.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-8rJZ3sn9Lgco1u6qaRxjmq8OhY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-270194-air-fryer-buffalo-chicken-wings-VAT-step-04-1inbasket-64daa85ff0674dff924b4b1c1b81dd13.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/270194/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the second batch is cooking, combine hot pepper sauce, butter, vinegar, garlic powder, and cayenne pepper in a small saucepan over medium heat. Stir and keep warm until wings are cooked.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DdMvmX-GNGn7YkyNiJgzF703-4U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-270194-air-fryer-buffalo-chicken-wings-VAT-step-05-1whisking-b4243ced31384c0484866a6b0eea82f5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/270194/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour sauce over cooked wings and toss to coat.",
